# 5. Today's Work — 24 October 2026

## Objective: Make Genie Look Like the Actual Product

An important concern raised during integration was that the frontend appeared too focused on fictional demonstration content, especially Nani.

The backend had been developed as a real persistent product, but the landing page was not communicating the full scope of its capabilities.

The goal was therefore to reposition Genie as a complete product experience while preserving clearly labelled fictional examples.

A detailed Claude refinement prompt was prepared using the backend report and engine contract as the source of truth.

The requested changes focused on product positioning, navigation, feature discovery, hospice integration and honest representation of real versus sample functionality.

